# Build artifact: a fresh web export exceeds GitHub's 100 MiB single-file cap.
# itch gets the fresh pck via butler straight from the runner disk; git never
# carries it (committing it froze the live build for many sessions).
web/game/index.pck

# session working files
scratchpad/

# Throwaway local web export used to browser-verify a change before shipping
# it (see .claude/skills/browser-verify-game/SKILL.md and
# founder-art-intake's "export locally, cleanup after" pattern). Never
# committed; `rm -rf` is blocked by this environment's permission policy, so
# leaving it in place and gitignoring it is the sanctioned cleanup.
web_verify/
